        "notes": "6-axis IMU (accelerometer + gyroscope) on the I2C bus, on every robot board (the user, 17 Nov 2026: \"Every robot\"): the turns close on the gyro's heading, the wheel encoders still give the distance. 1.71-3.6 V, 0.45 mA (gyro and accelerometer at 208 Hz, Table 4). Wired by the board generator: SCL/SDA to the bus, VDD and VDDIO to 3V3 with 100 nF each (Table 2 note 1), CS to VDDIO (I2C mode), SA0/SDx/SCx to GND (address 0x6A, Mode 1), INT1/INT2/NC open. Gyro: CTRL2_G (11h) = 0x44 (104 Hz, +/-500 dps), 17.5 mdps/LSB (Table 3), OUTZ_L_G/OUTZ_H_G (26h/27h).",
